// RULE: M1
// (0.30.1) A value a statement evaluates and drops is an operand (rustc's
// as_temp): a place it ends in whose type is not Copy is moved, whatever
// its Drop, wherever it comes from (`p;`, a block's tail, an if's, an
// unsafe block's, a break's value, `let _ = { p };`); a `&mut` is moved
// too, and `{ *r }` of a `&P` moves out of a reference (rustc E0382,
// E0507). Before, each was a mention only, read but never moved.
// ERROR: error[borrowck.use_moved]
